# Current architecture

Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/CORE_PRODUCT_V1_BASELINE.md`,
`docs/CORE_PRODUCT_V1_COMPLETION_CONTRACT.md`, and `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.

Sources → evidence adapters → executable construction → candidate → mechanical
validation → append-only sealed revision → independent read/inspection.

Applications own domain interpretation, authority, policies and workflows.
Do not modify core unless a concrete requirement cannot be represented honestly
with existing primitives without violating a frozen guarantee. Preserve the
four-region architecture; maintenance and inspection are not new layers.

Legacy in-place rebuilds do not preserve prior revisions. Research/archive
documents and old model protocols are not current product instructions. Follow
the shared guide for tests and packaging; no live LLM is required by core.
